{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"艾萨克·牛顿·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"isaac-newton","categoryLabel":"艾萨克·牛顿","chapterCount":3,"docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/22_isaac-newton/4_major-works","introHtml":"<hr>\n<h2 id=\"title-艾萨克-牛顿-代表成就\">title: 艾萨克·牛顿·代表成就</h2><h1 id=\"艾萨克-牛顿-代表成就\">艾萨克·牛顿·代表成就</h1><p>本知识中心是&quot;牛顿&quot;系列六个知识中心里的<strong>作品中心</strong>：它不讲牛顿的人生轨迹，也不做哲学层面的方法论提炼，而是逐部、逐定律地拆解牛顿留给世界的<strong>具体成就</strong>——一部书、一条定律、一个定理本身写了什么、怎么得来、为何重要。如果你想知道&quot;流数术的核心记号是什么&quot;&quot;《原理》三卷分别讲什么&quot;&quot;判决性实验如何证明白光可分&quot;，这里是答案所在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本中心-vs-兄弟中心的分工边界\">本中心 vs 兄弟中心的分工边界</h2><p>牛顿系列共六个中心，主题高度相邻，容易混淆。下表给出明确的取舍边界，帮助你直接跳到正确的入口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中心</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本中心的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>4 代表成就</strong>（本中心）</td>\n<td>这部著作 / 这条定律本身是什么？怎么推导？</td>\n<td>以&quot;作品 / 成果&quot;为单位组织，深入内容细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>牛顿对各学科的贡献有哪些、各占什么地位？</td>\n<td>以&quot;学科贡献&quot;为单位，更概览、更评价导向；本中心更聚焦单件作品的内部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>牛顿怎么做科学？方法论与世界观是什么？</td>\n<td>讲&quot;我不杜撰假说&quot;&quot;绝对时空&quot;等方法/观念，不复述定律内容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>这些成就在何时、何种处境下诞生？</td>\n<td>按时间线叙事，本中心按作品主题组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这些成就身后如何流传、被超越？</td>\n<td>向后看影响，本中心向内看成就本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>优先权之争、炼金术、性格阴暗面如何评判？</td>\n<td>专攻争议与隐秘面，本中心仅在成果脉络内点到为止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>想了解&quot;成果写了什么&quot;看本中心；想了解&quot;贡献多大 / 怎么做 / 何时做 / 后世如何&quot;分别看 2/3/1/5/6 中心。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"内容地图\">内容地图</h2><p>本中心按牛顿三大领域分为三章，共七篇：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 数学</strong>：<a href=\"mathematics/calculus-invention\">微积分的发明：流数术</a>、<a href=\"mathematics/binomial-theorem-and-algebra\">广义二项式定理与代数</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 力学与引力</strong>：<a href=\"mechanics-and-gravitation/principia-mathematica\">《自然哲学的数学原理》</a>、<a href=\"mechanics-and-gravitation/three-laws-of-motion\">三大运动定律</a>、<a href=\"mechanics-and-gravitation/universal-gravitation\">万有引力定律</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 光学与历史影响</strong>：<a href=\"optics-and-legacy/opticks-and-light\">《光学》与光的本性</a>、<a href=\"optics-and-legacy/scientific-legacy-and-controversies\">科学遗产与历史争议</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>物理 / 工科入门者</strong>：直接从第二章入手——<a href=\"mechanics-and-gravitation/three-laws-of-motion\">三大运动定律</a> → <a href=\"mechanics-and-gravitation/universal-gravitation\">万有引力定律</a> → 回看 <a href=\"mechanics-and-gravitation/principia-mathematica\">《原理》</a> 了解它们的来历。这是与大学力学课程衔接最紧的路线。</li>\n<li><strong>数学爱好者</strong>：按 <a href=\"mathematics/binomial-theorem-and-algebra\">广义二项式定理与代数</a> → <a href=\"mathematics/calculus-invention\">微积分的发明：流数术</a> 的顺序读，前者是后者的工具基石。</li>\n<li><strong>科学史 / 通识读者</strong>：按成书时间顺序读——<a href=\"mathematics/calculus-invention\">微积分</a>（1665 奇迹年）→ <a href=\"mechanics-and-gravitation/principia-mathematica\">《原理》</a>（1687）→ <a href=\"optics-and-legacy/opticks-and-light\">《光学》</a>（1704）→ <a href=\"optics-and-legacy/scientific-legacy-and-controversies\">科学遗产与历史争议</a>，最能体会一个人如何在四十年间重塑科学。</li>\n<li><strong>只想速览</strong>：读每篇末尾的&quot;小结&quot;即可建立全貌，再按兴趣深入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>各篇的史实部分无需任何基础，但要读懂推导细节，建议具备：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数学篇</strong>：高中函数与多项式即可入门；若想理解流数术与现代微积分的对应，可参考 <a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/calculus-applications/differential-calculus/derivatives-rules\">数学·微分学·导数与求导法则</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>力学篇</strong>：初中物理的力与运动概念足以入门；矢量记号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{F}=m\\vec{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的完整含义可对照 <a href=\"../../../education/university/natural-sciences/mechanics/theoretical-mechanics/dynamics-and-energy\">大学·力学·理论力学·动力学与能量</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>光学篇</strong>：无需前置；若想衔接现代光学概念，见 <a href=\"../../../photography-video/optics-basics/light-physics/nature-of-light\">摄影·光学基础·光的本性</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解牛顿，需要既看见他作为&quot;理性时代奠基者&quot;的一面，也看见经济学家凯恩斯所说的&quot;最后一位魔法师&quot;的一面。本中心力求在准确史料的基础上，把每一项成就讲透——它的内容、它的来历、它至今未褪的分量。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mathematics","title":"数学革命","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/mathematics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"calculus-invention","title":"微积分的发明：流数术","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/mathematics/calculus-invention"},{"seq":2,"slug":"binomial-theorem-and-algebra","title":"广义二项式定理与代数","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/mathematics/binomial-theorem-and-algebra"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mechanics-and-gravitation","title":"力学与万有引力","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/mechanics-and-gravitation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"principia-mathematica","title":"《自然哲学的数学原理》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/mechanics-and-gravitation/principia-mathematica"},{"seq":2,"slug":"three-laws-of-motion","title":"三大运动定律","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/mechanics-and-gravitation/three-laws-of-motion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"universal-gravitation","title":"万有引力定律","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/mechanics-and-gravitation/universal-gravitation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"optics-and-legacy","title":"光学与历史影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/optics-and-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"opticks-and-light","title":"《光学》与光的本性","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/optics-and-legacy/opticks-and-light"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scientific-legacy-and-controversies","title":"科学遗产与历史争议","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/isaac-newton/major-works/optics-and-legacy/scientific-legacy-and-controversies"}]}]}